      "created_at": "2025-11-03T22:30:21.246Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Built entirely on <strong>React and Frappe UI</strong>, <strong>KLiK POS</strong> is open-source and crafted for <strong>Saudi retailers</strong> who need a fast, reliable, and compliant PoS experience.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/light_bulb.png?v=14\" title=\":light_bulb:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":light_bulb:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Why KLiK POS?</strong><br>\nThe default ERPNext PoS often lacks strong UX, modern features, and ZATCA compliance. KLiK POS closes this gap—offering a <strong>clean, intuitive, and compliant</strong> checkout experience built for speed and flexibility.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=14\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Highlights:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Fully ZATCA Phase 2 Compliant (B2B &amp; B2C)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/credit_card.png?v=14\" title=\":credit_card:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":credit_card:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Multiple Payment Methods &amp; Round-off Handling</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/package.png?v=14\" title=\":package:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":package:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Barcode Scanner Mode for Quick Sales</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/mobile_phone.png?v=14\" title=\":mobile_phone:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":mobile_phone:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Share Invoices via Email, WhatsApp, or SMS</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/receipt.png?v=14\" title=\":receipt:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":receipt:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Multi-Invoice Credit Notes</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/busts_in_silhouette.png?v=14\" title=\":busts_in_silhouette:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":busts_in_silhouette:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Easy Customer Management</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>KLiK POS integrates seamlessly with ERPNext v15+ and pairs perfectly with the <strong>Beveren ZATCA Integration App</strong> for end-to-end compliance.</p>",
